cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its accompanying methodology, please cite it as below."
title: "GSA-CPD: Generalized Stochastic Approximation for Robust Sequential Change-Point Detection"
abstract: >-
  Public release of the GSA-CPD package: a Python implementation of a
  moment-based approximation of the log-likelihood ratio (GSA-LLR) for
  sequential change-point detection in non-Gaussian time series, together
  with a Lean 4 formalization of the core theorems and a reproducible
  Monte Carlo study. Real-data benchmark results are reported in the
  accompanying paper (Section 5).
